# Commission UI

When editing commission settlement or rate pages:

1. Verify on local web with Super Admin login.
2. Run `npm run test:commission-qa` in techhind-solar-api.
3. New roles → update `src/app/commission-settlements/utils/roleFilters.js`.
4. Offset rules apply to Handled by, Channel partner, and Inquiry by only.
